OL,3,AWidow's Bay and Beast in Me star
OL,4,AMatthew Rhys makes Emmy Awards history
OL,5,Awith two lead acting role wins
OL,6,
OL,7,FLaw & Order star Mariska Hargitay is
OL,8,Fsinging, cracking jokes and bringing
OL,9,Fout tons of big-name celebrities -
OL,10,Fincluding Taylor Swift - during the
OL,11,F78th Primetime Emmy Awards - she's the
OL,12,Ffirst woman to host the show in 15
OL,13,Fyears
OL,15,FWelsh actor Matthew Rhys makes history
OL,16,Fwith wins in two lead actor categories
OL,17,Ffor his work in Widow's Bay and The
OL,18,FBeast in Me - here is the full list of
OL,19,Fall the winners
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
