OL,3,AWidow's Bay and Beast in Me star
OL,4,AMatthew Rhys makes Emmy Awards history
OL,5,Awith two lead acting role wins
OL,6,
OL,7,FActress Jean Smart won her eighth Emmy
OL,8,F- and fifth consecutive for the comedy
OL,9,Fseries Hacks - which tied her for the
OL,10,Fmost acting awards, while British
OL,11,Factress Kate O'Flynn got the first win
OL,12,Fof the night for Widow's Bay, telling
OL,13,FBBC her a message for those back home -
OL,14,F"to our family and friends, we did it!"
OL,16,FLeading the pack in nominations tonight
OL,17,Fis medical drama The Pitt, which is up
OL,18,Ffor 25 awards - read more about the
OL,19,Fshow here.
